A||||12||SteveJ||Ejection seats for Fieros||||1||
Z||000000||SteveJ||06-15-2001||05:34 PM||||We seem to have several threads going on now about seatbelts with some people claiming not to use them. I think they are just leading us on to get a spirited conversation going but you gotta take 'em at their word. One of the major things they keep repeating is they heard of somebody somewhere that got thrown clear of a bad one and lived so that's how they want to handle it ( is this logic? ) Also you hear they were in one or more slow speed collisions and they talk about reaction time or reflexes. <BR>Well anybody who has been in a high speed collision knows there isn't any time and it's inertia not reflexes that count.<BR>So to keep our brother Fiero enthusiasts alive we need a more passive system - ejection seats. They wanna be thrown out of the car lets throw 'em out. Everybody get T- tops and we will even give 'em a parachute. System triggers - brakes locks on all four wheels.||||reg||1
Z||000001||SteveJ||06-15-2001||05:37 PM||||I know you are gunna ask where they are going to land. I don't know but those pilots in the dangerous video shows always seem to come out of it OK. . . and the nature of these guys it to trust to providence anyway, so . . .||||reg||1
Z||000002||JSocha||06-15-2001||05:39 PM||||I like that mod idea.  When are you going to have it completed?  What will be the cost?<P>Is there going to be a bypass, so if you don't like somebody or just want to get rid of unneccesary baggage (wife/gf/bf/husband/kids) just because and when near a secluded are, you can hit a button and "Fwoop!" out they go?<P>Gonna mount cameras? <P>Oh, and if they hook up there seatbelts, can it be set to automatic and/or manual mode for either a qwick or delayed "Fwooop!" out they go?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> j/k!<P>Keep us all posted!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||14
