Z||000005||BAM-BAM||06-15-2001||08:05 PM|||| If you use the ACES II ground zero ejectiojn system like the fighter aircraft use,, you don't have to worry about landing. A 500ft AGL the chute opens and you glide down. Now if we could just get the power company to put thier transmission lines underground  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> Ah, I kill me!!<P>Peace,, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||1
